<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ollama on Daily Deep Think</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/tags/ollama/</link><description>Recent content in Ollama on Daily Deep Think</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 14:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/tags/ollama/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>PDF2Markdown: Complete Guide to Smart PDF Article Extraction</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/pdf2markdown-intelligent-pdf-extraction-tool/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/en/pdf2markdown-intelligent-pdf-extraction-tool/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;PDF2Markdown - An Intelligent Article Extraction Tool for Large PDF Documents&#10; &lt;div id="pdf2markdown---an-intelligent-article-extraction-tool-for-large-pdf-documents" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#pdf2markdown---an-intelligent-article-extraction-tool-for-large-pdf-documents" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://python.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt="Python Version"&#10; src="https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.13&amp;#43;-blue.svg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt="Code Style"&#10; src="https://img.shields.io/badge/code%20style-ruff-green.svg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="https://mypy.readthedocs.io/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt="Type Checking"&#10; src="https://img.shields.io/badge/type%20checking-mypy-blue.svg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="LICENSE" &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt="License"&#10; src="https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Project Overview&#10; &lt;div id="project-overview" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#project-overview" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;PDF2Markdown is an intelligent content extraction tool built specifically for large scanned PDF files. It combines traditional OCR technology with modern AI large language models to intelligently extract pure article content from documents, automatically filtering out non-article elements such as images and tables. Mixed Chinese-English documents are fully supported.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>RAG Complete Guide: Build a Local RAG System from Scratch</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/rag-system-complete-guide-langchain-ollama-pgvector/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Aug 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.si